WEBVTT

00:31:57.788 --> 00:32:01.663
This is now accelerated the evidence
that this is a valid

00:32:01.663 --> 00:32:04.579
and really productive way to work.
I've never said those words.

00:32:04.579 --> 00:32:05.621
I've never said this before.

00:32:06.788 --> 00:32:08.704
We're not going to hold you accountable.
Thank you.

00:32:09.496 --> 00:32:12.996
Next question from one
magician to another.

00:32:13.204 --> 00:32:16.204
How does all the time you've
spent learning magic tricks

00:32:16.204 --> 00:32:18.246
and performing them affect your job?

00:32:18.246 --> 00:32:20.246
Has it spilled over into your
work life in any way?

00:32:21.204 --> 00:32:23.913
I think the thing about magic,

00:32:23.913 --> 00:32:28.496
as much as some might see it as the
geekiest sort of, you know,

00:32:28.496 --> 00:32:31.538
silliest thing to me, it's
incredibly powerful.